# Git Worktrees

Place all git worktrees inside `.worktrees/<name>` at the repository root:

```bash
git worktree add .worktrees/<name> -b <branch-name>
```

- `.worktrees/` is git-ignored; keep all worktree directories inside `.worktrees/` rather than outside the repository.
- Run `npm ci` inside a new worktree before building, linting, or running tests.
